# SPONGE DEMONSTRATION LEVEL - trivially 3-star, not a puzzle.
# A sponge is thirsty rock: it must end up wet, and it never passes water on.
# So it always costs you a dead-end branch. Here the branch is one tile long and
# the tee that feeds it is the only real decision. Same job level 13 does for the
# arrow: introduce the symbol doing nothing surprising.
id: 8
name: Thirsty Rock
size: 5x5
par: 4
tide: 10
